:"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/menuIndicator(_:)":{"abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"menuIndicator"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI10VisibilityO","text":"Visibility"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/menuIndicator(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/menuindicator(_:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"menuIndicator(_:)"}}}